{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>ילחכו</b> — Two times in the Masorah: ילחכו הקהל, ילחכו עפר כנחש in Trei Asar, in the verse רעה עמך בשבטך, which speaks of the theme of redemption. And that is what is written: כאשר שמע למצרים יחילו כשמע צור — to say: just as their fear fell upon all the nations, so shall it be in the future."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:48.528194919Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}